            "_comment": "xy is the pick-station frame (400, -650 mm) plus its box_origin_offset_mm (200, 900 mm), giving (600, 250) mm. z assumes the conveyor surface sits at lowest_point_height_mm (200 mm) with the box centred half a box height above it. The vendored package settles neither the surface height nor pick_home_z_offset_mm's role for a resting box, so z is a GPU-time question, not a sourced number the way xy is.",
